Package: KMerEnrich
Title: Semi-Targeted SMART-9N Primer Design for Viral Enrichment
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Emile", "Van Cauwenberghe", email = "milouvancau@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Designs semi-specific SMART-9N primers that enrich viral RNA over a
    host/vector background using k-mer statistics, RNA accessibility, thermodynamic
    filtering, and integer-linear-programming coverage optimisation.
